atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
hard_particles yes
region box block -0.008 0.008 -0.008 0.008 -0.008 0.008 units box
create_box 2 box
neighbor 4.000000000000001e-06 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
fix m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 100000000.0 100000000.0
fix m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3 0.3
fix m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 2 0.8 0.8 0.8 0.8
fix m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 2 10.0 10.0 10.0 10.0
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history synchronized_verlet on limitForce on
pair_coeff * *
create_atoms 1 single -0.002 0 0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 0.002 0 0 units box
create_atoms 2 single 0 9.697944826929669e-05 0.00026644884427106036 units box
set type 1 diameter 0.004 density 2500
set type 2 diameter 4e-05 density 2500
group fine type 2
group big type 1
fix fr big freeze
fix grav all gravity 9.81 vector 0 0 -1
fix integr fine nve/sphere
timestep 1.400070003500175e-08
variable th equal atan2(xcm(fine,y),xcm(fine,z))*180/PI
variable d1 equal sqrt((xcm(fine,x)+0.002)^2+xcm(fine,y)^2+xcm(fine,z)^2)
variable d2 equal sqrt((xcm(fine,x)-0.002)^2+xcm(fine,y)^2+xcm(fine,z)^2)
thermo_style custom step v_th v_d1 v_d2
thermo_modify format float %.12g norm no
thermo 71
run 7142500
